  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HYDROLOGICAL RESTORATION AT RA CELESTUN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ra Celestn Biosphere Reserve in the state of Yucatn is located along the western side of the coast of the Yucatn Peninsula. This area is a priority habitat for waterfowl, shorebirds, wading birds and neotropical migratory songbirds. The project will restore the hydrology of 13,335.53 acres of coastal wetlands in the Celestn Biosphere Reserve. It will also evaluate hydrodynamics, water quality, submerged vegetation coverage, fisheries productivity, and habitat use by resident and migratory birds.</narrative>
  </description>
